messages:
Maya: quick sync — we need a concrete ingest contract + dashboard for KV prefetch and prefix cache effectiveness. goal: per-tenant + per-workload reuse/hit/eviction signals usable by console and routing policy rules. who can own schema?

Samir: I can drive runtime tags. proposed metrics:
- kvcache_prefetch_hits_total{tenant,workload,model}
- kvcache_prefetch_miss_total{tenant,workload,model}
- kvcache_evictions_total{tenant,workload,model}
- kvcache_kv_reuse_ratio{tenant,workload,model} (gauge computed as reuse/attempts)
We should also emit latency histograms for prefetch and lookup.
Would prefer Prometheus-friendly names.

Olivia: infra will handle ingestion path. two asks:
1) add unique sample_id label (e.g., prefix_hash) to help dedupe in downstream
2) metrics must include kvcache_node and region

Diego: observability: dashboard needs heatmap of reuse_by_workload, 95/50 latency, and eviction spikes correlated with ingress qps. Also need rollup per-tenant and global.

Nisha: console product: want UX to show 'benefit estimate' — estimated token-savings and cost-saved from cache. Need a daily aggregate and a per-deployment timeseries. Also need boolean flag from runtime to indicate 'cacheable' route for routing policies.

Samir: agree. suggest adding metric kvcache_route_cacheable_total{route,tenant} increments when request eligible.

Maya: open question: quotas and routing. We might tie fallback policy to observed reuse rate < X for 5m. Need clear SLA for metric freshness (<1m).

Olivia: ingestion lag will be ~30s. we can push to ~10s if we batch smaller. infra prefers 30s by default; can support 10s for selected tenants.

Samir: include proto sketch:

```proto
message KVCacheMetric {
  string tenant = 1;
  string workload = 2;
  string model = 3;
  string prefix_hash = 4;
  enum Type { PREFETCH_HIT = 0; PREFETCH_MISS = 1; EVICTION = 2; LOOKUP_LATENCY = 3; ROUTE_CACHEABLE = 4; }
  Type type = 5;
  double value = 6;
  uint64 ts_ms = 7;
}
```

Diego: PromQL example for dashboard (reuse rate):

```
sum by (tenant,workload) (increase(kvcache_prefetch_hits_total[5m]))
/ sum by (tenant,workload) (increase(kvcache_prefetch_attempts_total[5m]))
```

Maya: Action items:
- Samir: proto + labels by EOD Thu
- Olivia: ingestion config + latency options by Fri
- Diego: dashboard mock by Mon
- Nisha: console copy + benefit calc spec by Mon
Tagging: @samir @olivia @diego @nisha

Nisha: noted. will add checkbox in rollout UX to toggle cache-visible metrics.

telemetry-bot: Created doc in Confluence: https://redwood/docs/kvcache-telemetry and Jira KVCACHE-324 assigned to Samir

Maya: thanks — will sync Thurs 10am. :thumbsup:
